<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>経済学 試験対策 問題集Webアプリ</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg:#f6f7fb; --panel:#ffffff; --text:#1f2937; --muted:#6b7280; --line:#e5e7eb;
  --accent:#2563eb; --accent2:#1d4ed8; --good:#16a34a; --bad:#dc2626; --warn:#f59e0b;
  --soft:#eff6ff; --goodsoft:#ecfdf5; --badsoft:#fef2f2;
}
* { box-sizing:border-box; }
body { margin:0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Hiragino Sans','Yu Gothic',Meiryo,sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); }
header { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a8a,#2563eb); color:white; padding:24px 18px; }
.header-inner { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; }
h1 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,40px); letter-spacing:.02em; }
.subtitle { margin:0; opacity:.92; line-height:1.7; }
main { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:18px; display:grid; grid-template-columns: 310px 1fr; gap:18px; }
.card { background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.06); }
.sidebar { padding:16px; height:max-content; position:sticky; top:14px; }
.content { padding:20px; min-height:70vh; }
label { display:block; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin:12px 0 6px; }
select, input[type=number] { width:100%; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:10px 12px; font-size:15px; background:white; color:var(--text); }
button { border:0; border-radius:12px; padding:10px 14px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; transition:.15s; }
.btn-primary { background:var(--accent); color:white; }
.btn-primary:hover { background:var(--accent2); }
.btn-secondary { background:#eef2ff; color:#1e40af; }
.btn-secondary:hover { background:#dbeafe; }
.btn-ghost { background:#f3f4f6; color:#374151; }
.btn-ghost:hover { background:#e5e7eb; }
.btn-danger { background:#fee2e2; color:#991b1b; }
.row { display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; }
.row button { flex:1; }
.stats { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px; margin:14px 0; }
.stat { background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:12px; }
.stat b { display:block; font-size:22px; margin-bottom:2px; }
.stat span { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
.progress { height:10px; background:#e5e7eb; border-radius:999px; overflow:hidden; margin:12px 0; }
.progress > div { height:100%; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#60a5fa,#2563eb); width:0%; transition:.3s; }
.pill { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:12px; color:#1e40af; background:#dbeafe; padding:5px 9px; border-radius:999px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:6px; }
.q-head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:12px; }
.q-num { color:var(--muted); font-weight:700; }
.question { font-size:22px; line-height:1.55; font-weight:800; margin:10px 0 18px; }
.choices { display:grid; gap:10px; }
.choice { width:100%; text-align:left; background:#fff; border:2px solid var(--line); padding:14px 16px; border-radius:16px; color:var(--text); font-weight:650; line-height:1.6; }
.choice:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color:#93c5fd; background:#f8fbff; }
.choice.selected { border-color:var(--accent); background:var(--soft); }
.choice.correct { border-color:var(--good); background:var(--goodsoft); color:#065f46; }
.choice.wrong { border-color:var(--bad); background:var(--badsoft); color:#991b1b; }
.choice:disabled { cursor:default; }
.feedback { margin-top:16px; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; line-height:1.8; display:none; }
.feedback.good { display:block; background:var(--goodsoft); border:1px solid #86efac; }
.feedback.bad { display:block; background:var(--badsoft); border:1px solid #fca5a5; }
.feedback h3 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:18px; }
.nav { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; margin-top:16px; }
.nav button { flex:1; }
.small { color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; line-height:1.7; }
.list { max-height:300px; overflow:auto; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; margin-top:12px; }
.list button { display:block; width:100%; text-align:left; background:white; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:0; color:var(--text); padding:10px 12px; font-weight:600; }
.list button:hover { background:#f9fafb; }
.list button:last-child { border-bottom:0; }
.notice { background:#fffbeb; border:1px solid #fcd34d; border-radius:14px; padding:12px; line-height:1.7; font-size:14px; }
.review-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin-top:12px; font-size:14px; }
.review-table th,.review-table td { border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding:10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; }
.review-table th { background:#f9fafb; }
.hidden { display:none !important; }
@media (max-width: 860px) { main { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .sidebar { position:static; } .q-head { flex-direction:column; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <h1>経済学 試験対策 問題集Webアプリ</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">アップロードされた授業資料・小テストをもとにした選択式問題集です。回答後に正誤判定と解説が出ます。試験直前は「苦手だけ」「ランダム」で回すのがおすすめです。</p>
  </div>
</header>
<main>
  <aside class="card sidebar">
    <div class="notice"><b>使い方</b><br>① 分野を選ぶ → ② 問題に回答 → ③ 解説を読む。<br>間違えた問題は自動で「苦手」に入ります。</div>
    <label>出題範囲</label>
    <select id="topicSelect"></select>
    <label>出題順</label>
    <select id="orderSelect">
      <option value="normal">通常順</option>
      <option value="shuffle">ランダム</option>
      <option value="wrong">苦手だけ</option>
    </select>
    <label>問題数</label>
    <input id="limitInput" type="number" min="1" value="20">
    <div class="row" style="margin-top:12px">
      <button class="btn-primary" id="startBtn">開始</button>
      <button class="btn-ghost" id="resetBtn">記録リセット</button>
    </div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><b id="totalCount">0</b><span>収録問題</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="scoreStat">0%</b><span>今回の正答率</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="doneStat">0</b><span>回答済み</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="wrongStat">0</b><span>苦手登録</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="progress"><div id="progressBar"></div></div>
    <p class="small">収録分野：ミクロ基礎、需要供給、余剰分析、政府介入、独占、情報の非対称性、外部性、公共財、取引費用、労働経済学。</p>
  </aside>

  <section class="card content">
    <div id="quizView"></div>
    <div id="resultView" class="hidden"></div>
  </section>
</main>

